WEBVTT

00:01.001 --> 00:03.920
WRITTEN BY: HYUGA NATSU
ILLUSTRATION: TOUKO SHINO

01:40.183 --> 01:41.601
Did someone summon me?

01:41.684 --> 01:43.603
The palace woman from the clinic did?

01:44.270 --> 01:46.815
Yes, it seems she wants to see you.

01:47.816 --> 01:50.527
I’m sorry. I should have taken

01:50.610 --> 01:52.695
the medicine you prepared right here.

01:53.780 --> 01:56.157
<i>But the palace woman</i>
<i>from yesterday saw me.</i>

01:57.450 --> 01:58.660
That's a problem.

01:58.743 --> 02:01.913
Only medical officers are allowed
to make medicine, after all.

02:01.996 --> 02:03.331
I deeply apologize.

02:03.998 --> 02:05.542
Will you get in trouble?

02:05.625 --> 02:08.294
No, it’s just that…

02:11.506 --> 02:12.549
Tell me what’s going on.

02:13.299 --> 02:14.175
Yes…

02:15.510 --> 02:17.178
They’re asking to…

02:17.262 --> 02:19.264
borrow Maomao for a while.

02:19.347 --> 02:20.807
Maomao?

02:24.936 --> 02:27.480
Ailan, call Yinghua for me.

02:27.564 --> 02:29.774
Eh? O-Okay.

02:36.364 --> 02:39.492
<i>I got summoned…</i>

02:42.787 --> 02:44.289
Let’s hurry.

02:45.039 --> 02:47.625
<i>They even sent someone</i>
<i>to keep an eye on me.</i>

02:50.879 --> 02:52.630
My name is Shenlü.

02:53.464 --> 02:55.675
<i>Eyes with a greenish hue…</i>

02:55.758 --> 02:58.636
<i>Is she, like Lady Gyokuyou,</i>
<i>from the western region?</i>

02:59.345 --> 03:01.806
<i>Yesterday, she seemed like</i>
<i>a strong-willed mother, but…</i>

03:01.890 --> 03:05.143
<i>now that we’re talking calmly,</i>
<i>she gives off an intelligent impression.</i>

03:05.226 --> 03:08.813
<i>In any case, being served tea</i>
<i>like this makes me feel awkward.</i>

03:08.897 --> 03:11.691
I was rude to you yesterday. My apologies.

03:11.774 --> 03:14.402
I didn’t realize
you worked under the Consort.

03:14.485 --> 03:15.862
No, it’s fine.

03:15.945 --> 03:18.573
<i>"Consort" refers to Lady Gyokuyou’s title.</i>

03:18.656 --> 03:21.993
<i>Palace women from outside often use</i>
<i>official titles to refer to them.</i>

03:23.202 --> 03:26.873
I summoned you because there’s
something I’d like to ask of you.

03:28.041 --> 03:29.334
Go ahead.

03:29.417 --> 03:31.377
I want you to make a medicine

03:31.461 --> 03:33.087
for Wise Consort, Lady Lihua's

03:33.171 --> 03:35.131
maid at the Crystal Pavilion.

03:37.175 --> 03:39.969
Do you understand what that implies?

03:40.053 --> 03:43.556
If it gets out that someone other than
a medical officer is making medicine--

03:43.640 --> 03:45.600
I am fully aware of the consequences.

03:46.684 --> 03:48.019
There seems to be a reason.

03:48.102 --> 03:49.520
Maomao?!

03:49.604 --> 03:51.356
Please, you can tell me.

03:52.857 --> 03:54.025
Is it alright?

03:58.863 --> 04:00.823
Could you explain the circumstances?

04:01.824 --> 04:03.326
Thank you very much.

04:04.494 --> 04:06.829
<i>She's a maid I became acquainted with</i>

04:06.913 --> 04:08.790
<i>at the laundry area.</i>

04:09.332 --> 04:10.792
<i>Since the caravan season,</i>

04:10.875 --> 04:13.836
<i>she's been experiencing fatigue</i>
<i>and a slight fever.</i>

04:13.920 --> 04:17.173
<i>Then it escalated into a strange cough.</i>

04:19.217 --> 04:22.971
<i>So I told her to take proper rest.</i>

04:23.054 --> 04:26.683
But after that, she completely
stopped showing up.

04:26.766 --> 04:28.476
Maybe she switched laundry areas,

04:28.559 --> 04:30.186
or was reassigned?

04:30.895 --> 04:32.105
Even so,

04:32.188 --> 04:34.732
that cough needs
to be checked at least once.

04:34.816 --> 04:37.485
So, she hasn't gone to the clinic either?

04:37.568 --> 04:38.444
Yes.

04:38.528 --> 04:41.364
Perhaps she couldn't get
permission from her superiors.

04:42.073 --> 04:44.450
<i>That's the problem</i>
<i>with the Crystal Pavilion.</i>

04:45.034 --> 04:46.744
<i>If the maid needed permission,</i>

04:46.828 --> 04:49.080
<i>it wouldn't be from Lady Lihua,</i>
<i>but from the head attendant.</i>

04:49.163 --> 04:52.250
<i>There's a high chance</i>
<i>her request was ignored.</i>

04:52.959 --> 04:56.838
It's already been half a month
since I last saw her.

04:57.463 --> 04:58.673
Half a month!?

05:02.552 --> 05:04.804
This has turned into
a troublesome situation.

05:04.887 --> 05:08.391
Does such a maid even exist?

05:08.474 --> 05:10.435
It might be necessary to investigate.

05:11.311 --> 05:12.895
<i>A strange cough, huh?</i>

05:12.979 --> 05:15.606
<i>If it's contagious,</i>
<i>we can't just leave it be.</i>

05:15.690 --> 05:18.109
<i>It might spread</i>
<i>outside of the Crystal Pavilion.</i>

05:19.485 --> 05:22.572
I know you're the type that worries
about these kind of things, but…

05:23.281 --> 05:25.450
make sure to ask for permission properly.

05:25.533 --> 05:28.453
Rushing ahead is your bad habit.

05:29.078 --> 05:30.121
Yes.

05:30.204 --> 05:31.706
<i>It won't help to rush.</i>

05:31.789 --> 05:34.083
<i>First, I'll have this issue passed</i>
<i>on to Lord Jinshi.</i>

05:34.167 --> 05:36.044
<i>What I can do right now is…</i>

05:37.170 --> 05:39.213
Ah?

05:39.297 --> 05:40.131
Wait!

05:40.214 --> 05:41.340
Maomao!

05:42.717 --> 05:44.677
Geez, just as I was saying…

05:45.470 --> 05:48.639
Sorry. I found what I was looking for,
so I couldn't help myself.

05:49.348 --> 05:51.517
-What were you looking for?
-This.

05:52.310 --> 05:55.229
Unfortunately, the main body
managed to escape.

05:56.898 --> 05:59.859
<i>I'm going to make medicine to grow it.</i>
<i>To do that…</i>

05:59.942 --> 06:00.860
I'm trying to figure out

06:00.943 --> 06:03.237
why its tail grows back.

06:04.906 --> 06:06.157
Lady Yinghua?

06:27.303 --> 06:28.304
Where are you going?

06:29.555 --> 06:30.973
Lady Shin!

06:31.682 --> 06:33.935
You’re supposed to be
cleaning the main house.

06:34.018 --> 06:35.728
Are you going to
show your face there again?

06:36.479 --> 06:37.855
Ah, well…

06:37.939 --> 06:41.192
I told you, don’t do unnecessary things.

06:43.361 --> 06:44.570
I’m sorry.

06:45.154 --> 06:47.073
I’m really sorry…

06:47.156 --> 06:48.074
Lady Shin!

06:48.699 --> 06:51.327
The doctor has arrived
from the medical office.

06:51.410 --> 06:52.578
Doctor?

06:54.163 --> 06:55.206
What does he want?

06:55.790 --> 06:58.167
He couldn’t even help the Crown Prince.

07:01.921 --> 07:03.548
Do you need something?

07:03.631 --> 07:06.717
Well… I wanted to see the Wise Consort.

07:08.344 --> 07:09.804
I apologize.

07:10.471 --> 07:11.639
Lady Lihua likely

07:11.722 --> 07:14.559
doesn't wish to meet with you.

07:14.642 --> 07:17.019
Well, but…

07:19.522 --> 07:22.608
<i>Such a tall woman.</i>
<i>Was there such a palace woman?</i>

07:27.447 --> 07:29.782
I received a letter like this.

07:29.866 --> 07:31.784
JINSHI

07:33.369 --> 07:35.496
I understand. This way, please.

07:36.998 --> 07:39.625
Excuse me, but Lady Lihua
is in good health.

07:41.419 --> 07:42.670
Ah, that's good to hear.

07:42.753 --> 07:44.380
You must have excellent attendants

07:44.464 --> 07:46.132
to support the Wise Consort.

07:46.215 --> 07:47.633
Of course we do.

07:47.717 --> 07:50.720
All attendants of the Crystal Pavilion
come from distinguished families.

07:51.220 --> 07:54.474
They are all worthy
of serving the Emperor.

07:54.557 --> 07:58.144
Lady Lihua is also of noble birth,
and from the royal family.

07:58.978 --> 08:01.898
<i>And so am I.</i>

08:02.482 --> 08:04.358
For the sake of the family,

08:04.442 --> 08:07.403
it is important to gain
the Emperor's favor.

08:07.487 --> 08:09.989
Understood, Lihua and Shin.

08:10.823 --> 08:11.908
-Yes.
-Yes.

08:12.533 --> 08:14.410
<i>Then why is it that…</i>

08:20.583 --> 08:21.792
What's the matter?

08:23.586 --> 08:24.462
Well…

08:24.545 --> 08:27.089
I was wondering what that
small building was.

08:29.759 --> 08:32.553
It's nothing, just a storage room.

08:34.972 --> 08:37.308
Have you been tending
to the garden recently?

08:38.893 --> 08:40.603
No, not particularly.

08:41.562 --> 08:44.565
<i>Now that you mention it, were there always</i>
<i>those bushes in the garden?</i>

08:45.942 --> 08:47.818
You're wearing perfume today.

08:47.902 --> 08:48.778
Huh?

08:49.695 --> 08:50.780
Lady Shin.

08:52.782 --> 08:54.242
Long time no see.

08:54.909 --> 08:57.620
I apologize for
what happened the other day.

09:00.331 --> 09:02.708
Are you the girl from that time?

09:05.044 --> 09:06.170
Wait a minute!

09:07.255 --> 09:08.172
What are you doing?!

09:14.178 --> 09:15.221
Young lady!

09:27.400 --> 09:30.152
Boil some water, now!

09:30.736 --> 09:31.904
All right.

09:40.496 --> 09:41.664
Drink this slowly.

09:49.839 --> 09:51.215
Why did you treat her like this?

09:52.300 --> 09:54.302
There's nothing to explain.

09:54.885 --> 09:56.596
It's to prevent the disease
from spreading.

09:56.679 --> 09:59.140
It's common sense
to isolate the patient, right?

09:59.724 --> 10:00.808
Indeed,

10:00.891 --> 10:03.894
but while the contagion risk is low,
this is still a transmissible illness.

10:05.354 --> 10:08.649
If such measures continue,
it will lead to her death.

10:09.692 --> 10:11.944
Of course, the death of a single maid

10:12.695 --> 10:14.530
may seem like a trivial matter to you.

10:18.075 --> 10:19.994
I remember when I first came here.

10:20.703 --> 10:23.497
It was when Lady Lihua was
bedridden due to illness.

10:24.081 --> 10:27.251
<i>A fragrance was burned to mask</i>
<i>the smell of the sick person.</i>

10:29.086 --> 10:30.796
What are you trying to say?

10:31.380 --> 10:34.258
This time, I felt it was the opposite.

10:34.342 --> 10:36.302
The sick person is being placed here

10:36.886 --> 10:38.888
to mask the smell of the fragrance.

10:43.100 --> 10:44.268
Wait!

10:46.187 --> 10:48.648
The Crystal Pavilion attendants

10:48.731 --> 10:50.816
really have many secrets, don't they?

10:51.734 --> 10:55.571
These are the goods from the caravan
that were banned recently.

10:56.238 --> 11:00.284
Once again, a poor eunuch
will be sentenced to lashes.

11:00.368 --> 11:01.285
<i>Don't get shaken up.</i>

11:06.666 --> 11:08.876
Each small bottle
may not be considered poisonous,

11:08.959 --> 11:10.961
but if you mix them together,
what could happen?

11:11.545 --> 11:14.173
<i>A girl like her could never understand.</i>

11:14.256 --> 11:15.800
<i>What my true purpose is.</i>

11:15.883 --> 11:17.093
Lady Shin.

11:18.386 --> 11:20.846
What are your intentions

11:20.930 --> 11:23.307
in creating an abortion pill?

11:34.860 --> 11:38.781
If I could find her on the first visit,
maybe I didn't need to disguise myself.

11:39.615 --> 11:43.202
<i>My face is known,</i>
<i>so I was prepared for a long battle.</i>

11:46.956 --> 11:48.249
Thank you for waiting.

11:48.958 --> 11:51.585
Thank you for the change of clothes.

11:52.169 --> 11:53.087
Of course.

11:53.170 --> 11:55.381
You shouldn't walk around
in the clothes you wore

11:55.464 --> 11:57.550
while caring for the sick,
as it could spread the illness.

11:58.217 --> 12:01.095
Shall we go? Everyone is gathered.

12:11.063 --> 12:14.066
What does this mean, Lady Shin?

12:14.567 --> 12:16.235
The items from the caravan

12:16.318 --> 12:19.572
were to be removed
because they were potentially toxic.

12:19.655 --> 12:21.824
I'm sure that was announced.

12:24.410 --> 12:26.120
<i>Are you going to keep silent?</i>

12:26.203 --> 12:28.581
<i>Even when questioned by Lord Jinshi,</i>
<i>she acts like this?</i>

12:29.957 --> 12:31.000
<i>Lady Shin.</i>

12:31.083 --> 12:33.085
<i>She is the head</i>
<i>of the Crystal Pavilion's attendants,</i>

12:33.169 --> 12:35.337
<i>and also a cousin of Lady Lihua.</i>

12:35.963 --> 12:38.716
<i>Her features are somewhat similar,</i>
<i>attracting attention.</i>

12:38.799 --> 12:40.551
<i>She's an evidently proud</i>
<i>and beautiful woman.</i>

12:41.135 --> 12:43.846
<i>That is why she became</i>
<i>the head of the attendants.</i>

12:45.097 --> 12:48.976
<i>Beautiful flowers are more noticeable</i>
<i>when gathered in one place.</i>

12:49.059 --> 12:52.813
<i>Given her status, it is not surprising</i>
<i>she moved up to a middle-level consort.</i>

12:52.897 --> 12:55.024
<i>She must be aware of that herself.</i>

12:56.025 --> 12:57.651
Let me change the question.

12:58.694 --> 13:01.155
What were you planning to do
with the prohibited goods?

13:02.031 --> 13:04.074
I don't know what you're talking about.

13:04.158 --> 13:08.537
Indeed, I did instruct that the sick maid
be laid down in the storage room.

13:09.205 --> 13:11.874
But that was to prevent
the spread of the disease.

13:12.708 --> 13:15.794
I didn't know what items were kept there.

13:15.878 --> 13:18.255
Does that make me guilty?

13:20.174 --> 13:23.761
<i>It's not a crime to isolate</i>
<i>the maid in the storage room.</i>

13:24.303 --> 13:27.264
<i>It can't be helped.…that's how little</i>
<i>a maid's life is valued.</i>

13:27.348 --> 13:28.724
Rather than that,

13:28.807 --> 13:30.601
you came out of nowhere

13:30.684 --> 13:33.229
and demanded to meet Lady Lihua.

13:33.312 --> 13:36.482
Isn't it more of a problem to go snooping
around in other palaces' storage rooms?

13:37.358 --> 13:40.528
<i>After all, the storage room is a place</i>
<i>where no one goes,</i>

13:40.611 --> 13:42.488
<i>except for delivering food to the sick.</i>

13:43.072 --> 13:46.200
To put it another way, anyone could
have approached the storage room.

13:46.283 --> 13:49.328
Do you have evidence that
these items belong to me?

13:49.411 --> 13:52.289
You should ask the maid
who was there in that room.

13:53.374 --> 13:54.792
Are you going to trust the words

13:54.875 --> 13:57.378
of a maid who was suffering
from a fever and was delirious?

13:57.461 --> 13:59.588
How reliable can she be?

14:00.256 --> 14:02.841
So, you knew she was
suffering from a fever?

14:04.301 --> 14:06.512
How kind of you.

14:06.595 --> 14:10.224
To go out of your way to check on
a lowly maid's condition.

14:11.183 --> 14:15.771
Then it's not surprising if the scent
of perfume oil lingers on your body.

14:16.647 --> 14:20.526
Before, there was no scent
of perfume oil on you, Lady Shin.

14:21.902 --> 14:24.029
<i>I shouldn’t go any further…</i>

14:25.197 --> 14:26.949
<i>I understand that, but…</i>

14:29.326 --> 14:31.537
<i>There are things that make one angry.</i>

14:32.246 --> 14:33.664
Today, Lady Shin,

14:34.415 --> 14:36.625
you smell just like this perfume oil.

14:38.210 --> 14:41.130
This bottle was found inside the chest.

14:41.672 --> 14:44.592
Is it really such a strong scent
that it can be picked up easily?

14:45.634 --> 14:46.510
Just to be sure,

14:47.303 --> 14:49.346
may I check?

14:53.726 --> 14:55.936
Don't touch me!

14:56.562 --> 14:57.688
Apothecary!

14:59.940 --> 15:01.317
It's nothing serious.

15:02.151 --> 15:03.235
You're right.

15:03.319 --> 15:06.864
I should have never touched you.

15:07.990 --> 15:10.200
Let's have someone else check you.

15:13.704 --> 15:16.498
Could you leave the rest to me?

15:18.834 --> 15:19.919
<i>Lady Lihua.</i>

15:21.128 --> 15:23.797
What crime will she be charged with?

15:23.881 --> 15:26.467
If she were trying to create
an abortion pill,

15:26.550 --> 15:28.928
it would be the same
as murdering the Emperor's child.

15:29.011 --> 15:32.014
Does that apply
no matter whose consort's child it is?

15:32.097 --> 15:33.349
Of course.

15:36.435 --> 15:39.980
Even if Shin's target was me?

15:41.231 --> 15:43.108
Lady Lihua! That's…

15:44.568 --> 15:46.195
<i>So that’s what this is about.</i>

15:46.820 --> 15:48.280
<i>Lady Lihua's clothes</i>

15:48.364 --> 15:50.616
<i>are similar to the clothes that</i>
<i>Lady Gyokuyou is wearing.</i>

15:51.825 --> 15:54.662
<i>That explains why there aren’t</i>
<i>any decent attendants.</i>

15:54.745 --> 15:56.330
<i>It’s not Lady Lihua's fault.</i>

15:56.830 --> 16:00.292
<i>Those attendants</i>
<i>were gathered intentionally</i>

16:00.960 --> 16:03.003
<i>by the head attendant, Shin.</i>

16:03.629 --> 16:07.091
Shin, you’ve never treated me
as a consort, have you?

16:07.174 --> 16:09.593
You thought I wasn’t worthy of being

16:11.053 --> 16:12.846
the mother of the nation.

16:12.930 --> 16:15.099
That’s what you must have thought.

16:15.683 --> 16:16.850
You and I,

16:17.685 --> 16:19.603
we never knew who would become a consort…

16:20.813 --> 16:23.315
until the very end.

16:26.443 --> 16:29.863
Speaking to me as if I'm inferior to you.

16:31.740 --> 16:34.284
I’ve always hated that about you!

16:35.244 --> 16:37.538
I was better at studying and etiquette!

16:38.205 --> 16:39.289
<i>And many other things!</i>

16:39.373 --> 16:41.959
<i>I was better than you in so many ways!</i>

16:42.876 --> 16:45.546
Why does everyone around me…!

16:46.255 --> 16:48.882
<i>The size of their chests… No.</i>

16:48.966 --> 16:51.051
<i>The difference in capacity</i>
<i>between them is simply too vast.</i>

16:52.302 --> 16:54.972
<i>"Lihua" and "Shin," "Pear" and "Apricot."</i>

16:55.055 --> 16:58.600
<i>Both were born with beautiful names,</i>
<i>having a good background and education.</i>

16:59.143 --> 17:03.480
<i>Still, there are plenty of foolish people</i>
<i>who are ruled by their emotions</i>

17:03.564 --> 17:05.232
<i>and make mistakes.</i>

17:05.315 --> 17:08.819
<i>Lady Shin is likely one of them.</i>

17:08.902 --> 17:11.155
Because you’re the daughter
of the head of the family?

17:11.238 --> 17:13.198
Does that make you better than me?

17:13.282 --> 17:14.450
That can't be!

17:14.533 --> 17:15.743
I’ve always been

17:15.826 --> 17:18.203
raised to become the mother of the nation!

17:19.413 --> 17:21.790
Can I take that as a confession?

17:25.461 --> 17:28.589
May you wither in the flower garden,
unable to bear children!

17:28.672 --> 17:30.758
Lihua!

17:35.929 --> 17:37.306
Don’t touch me!

17:37.389 --> 17:38.849
How disgusting, a mere eunuch!

17:39.349 --> 17:41.852
Let go of me! Let go of me!

17:42.853 --> 17:44.188
Lady Shin,

17:44.271 --> 17:46.857
you really do hold the Emperor
in high regard, don’t you?

17:47.441 --> 17:50.861
-Of course I do! What are you saying?
-No.

17:51.904 --> 17:52.863
I just…

17:54.740 --> 17:58.869
simply thought you seemed to love
the position of the mother of the nation.

17:59.495 --> 18:01.413
Unlike Lady Lihua.

18:16.512 --> 18:19.640
You thought that way, Shin?

18:27.189 --> 18:28.899
Lord Jinshi,

18:28.982 --> 18:32.277
this head attendant has
spoken violent words.

18:32.861 --> 18:34.947
To the point where I had to step in.

18:35.614 --> 18:37.991
Therefore, I will dismiss this person.

18:38.075 --> 18:39.952
Lady Lihua, that is…

18:40.035 --> 18:42.162
Oh, is a slap not enough?

18:43.831 --> 18:45.124
Then, let me do it…

18:45.207 --> 18:46.291
Please wait!

18:46.375 --> 18:47.584
I won’t!

18:48.836 --> 18:51.880
<i>She's really changed. She's not</i>
<i>the old Lady Lihua anymore.</i>

18:52.965 --> 18:56.510
<i>A woman waiting for</i>
<i>her own life to fade away</i>

18:56.593 --> 18:57.719
<i>is nowhere to be found.</i>

18:58.262 --> 18:59.763
From now on,

18:59.847 --> 19:02.391
please forbid her
from entering the rear palace.

19:02.975 --> 19:04.893
<i>What a light punishment…</i>

19:04.977 --> 19:07.855
<i>But for this woman,</i>
<i>it will be enough humiliation.</i>

19:07.938 --> 19:09.481
<i>Even if she bears a grudge,</i>

19:09.565 --> 19:13.402
<i>she can’t do anything, as she was</i>
<i>driven out of the rear palace by scandal.</i>

19:14.361 --> 19:17.865
<i>I'm sure they will never</i>
<i>stand beside each other.</i>

19:21.577 --> 19:23.328
-Use it.
-Huh?

19:24.705 --> 19:26.456
You're bleeding.

19:26.540 --> 19:28.834
It’s fine, it’s just a scar.

19:29.418 --> 19:30.878
Just use it!

19:31.628 --> 19:32.462
Fine.

19:33.547 --> 19:36.717
<i>To stain such fine silk with blood…</i>

19:37.593 --> 19:40.387
How did you know the sick maid
was in the storage room?

19:40.470 --> 19:42.890
Since you were in disguise,

19:42.973 --> 19:45.184
I’m sure you didn’t know
from the start, right?

19:46.059 --> 19:48.395
I had a rough idea.

19:49.188 --> 19:50.189
Since she was ill,

19:50.272 --> 19:53.567
she had to be somewhere out of sight,
away from everyone’s sleeping areas.

19:54.193 --> 19:56.778
I didn’t think it would be
the storage room, though.

19:57.279 --> 19:59.990
And there was a clue.

20:01.116 --> 20:02.367
Those bushes?

20:02.951 --> 20:03.869
Yes.

20:03.952 --> 20:06.830
Normally those flowers are red.

20:06.914 --> 20:09.416
But only white flowers are blooming.

20:09.499 --> 20:11.460
Someone must have chosen and planted them.

20:12.127 --> 20:16.256
In Feng Shui, the combination of green
and white is said to be good for health.

20:16.340 --> 20:17.591
I see…

20:18.217 --> 20:19.426
And the name…

20:19.509 --> 20:22.304
'Marvel-of-Peru' is rather ironic.

20:22.888 --> 20:24.014
Marvel-of-Peru?

20:24.097 --> 20:26.516
The white powder in the seeds

20:26.600 --> 20:28.769
can also be used as an abortion drug.

20:30.229 --> 20:31.605
Those flowers are everywhere!

20:31.688 --> 20:35.442
As long as you don’t misuse them,
it won’t do any harm.

20:35.525 --> 20:37.110
Just like today’s perfume.

20:40.155 --> 20:41.531
How did Lady Shin know

20:41.615 --> 20:44.660
that perfume could be used
as an abortion drug?

20:45.244 --> 20:48.622
Also, being that it was one of
the trade goods brought in by the caravan.

20:49.706 --> 20:52.834
Even if I interrogate her,
I don’t know if she’ll spill anything.

20:53.835 --> 20:56.588
Apothecary, may I ask you something.

20:57.798 --> 20:59.591
Within this rear palace,

20:59.675 --> 21:02.886
is there someone who spread the idea that
perfume could be used as an abortion drug?

21:04.680 --> 21:05.555
I don't know.

21:06.348 --> 21:10.060
However, it would be best
to stay cautious.

21:14.731 --> 21:16.275
Um…

21:19.820 --> 21:21.321
Marvel-of-Peru.

21:21.405 --> 21:24.241
What happened to the maid
in the storage room?

21:24.324 --> 21:27.452
She will be leaving the rear palace
and will receive treatment.

21:28.078 --> 21:29.830
<i>That was what Lady Lihua suggested.</i>

21:29.913 --> 21:32.207
<i>She feels responsible for what happened,</i>

21:32.291 --> 21:34.209
<i>so she will bear the cost as well.</i>

21:36.044 --> 21:37.129
I see…

21:49.224 --> 21:51.101
It seems that the apothecary has visited.

21:51.977 --> 21:55.105
Yes. You seem to know everything.

21:55.188 --> 21:57.607
I've been saved by her countless times.

22:04.031 --> 22:05.365
Is something the matter?

22:08.785 --> 22:09.911
No…

23:57.102 --> 23:58.145
<i>Next episode…</i>

23:58.228 --> 24:00.355
"Shrine of Choosing."
